1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,250
Final day. The sky turns red.

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,630
Aliens are here.

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:07,410
Humanity has one army left: one million Optimus robots.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,350
They charge.

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,070
The ships are too big.

6
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,430
Lasers bounce off.

7
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,910
Robots fall by the thousands.

8
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,390
Then the mothership arrives.

9
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:15,750
Ten kilometers wide.

10
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,180
Nothing on Earth can touch it.

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,570
The robots stop.

12
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,530
Every single one.

13
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,570
Did they just give up?

14
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:25,450
No. They were calculating.

15
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,250
They start climbing onto each other.

16
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,140
Arms lock. Legs lock.

17
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,200
A million machines,

18
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,850
becoming one. A giant the size of a mountain.

19
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,790
And for the first time, the aliens back away.

20
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:39,440
Your move: one giant robot, or a million small ones?

21
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,550
Which army wins?

22
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:41,510
Comment below.
